          "why": "Both movements increase the cyclist's position in the same direction.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Distance = 4 + 1 = 5 km.\nStep 2: The cyclist finishes 5 km east of the start.\nStep 3: Displacement = 5 km east.",
          "hint": "Both parts are in the same direction.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "linear_motion",
          "topic": "Distance and Displacement Compared",
          "conceptId": "math_linear_motion_distance_and_displacement_compared",
          "skillId": "math_linear_motion",
