          "why": "Average velocity uses displacement divided by total time.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Displacement = 100 km east.\nStep 2: Time = 2 h.\nStep 3: Average velocity = 100 ÷ 2.\nStep 4: Average velocity = 50 km/h east.",
          "hint": "Use displacement ÷ time.",
          "subject": "math",
