          "why": "The car closes the 30 km gap at 30 km/h.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Relative speed = 90 − 60 = 30 km/h\nStep 2: Time = 30 / 30\nStep 3: Time = 1 hour",
          "hint": "Subtract the speeds, then divide the gap by the relative speed.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "linear_motion",
