          "sol": "Step 1: Stage 1 = 180 / 60 = 3 h\nStep 2: Stage 2 = 100 / 50 = 2 h\nStep 3: Total time = 3 + 2 = 5 h",
          "hint": "Find the time for each stage using t = d/s.",
