          "why": "Numbers increase as we move from left to right on a number line.",
          "sol": "Step 1: −4 lies to the left of zero.\nStep 2: +2 lies to the right of zero.\nStep 3: Therefore +2 is farther to the right.",
          "hint": "Look at their positions on the number line.",
          "subject": "math",
