          "why": "Equal vertically opposite angles give an equation.",
          "sol": "Step 1: 5x - 8 = 72\nStep 2: 5x = 80\nStep 3: x = 16.",
          "hint": "Set the two angle expressions equal.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "geometry",
          "topic": "Vertically Opposite Angles",
