          "why": "Opposite sides of a parallelogram have equal lengths.",
          "sol": "Step 1: AB and CD are opposite sides.\nStep 2: Therefore, AB = CD.\nStep 3: CD = 14 cm.",
          "hint": "Opposite sides of a parallelogram are equal.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "geometry",
          "topic": "Parallelogram: Opposite Sides Are Equal",
          "conceptId": "math_geometry_parallelogram_opposite_sides_are_equal",
          "skillId": "math_geometry",
          "subskillId": "math_geometry_q1"
