          "why": "The radius is half the diameter.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Radius = diameter ÷ 2.\nStep 2: Radius = 26 ÷ 2.\nStep 3: Radius = 13 cm.",
          "hint": "Divide the diameter by 2.",
          "subject": "math",
