          "why": "The diameter passes through the centre and spans two radii.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The radius is 8 cm.\nStep 2: Diameter = 2 × radius.\nStep 3: Diameter = 2 × 8 = 16 cm.\nStep 4: The learner forgot that the diameter is twice the radius.",
          "hint": "The learner has treated the radius and diameter as the same length.",
          "subject": "math",
