          "why": "The area formula is length multiplied by width, not their sum.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Adding the dimensions gives 10 + 6 = 16, not 32.\nStep 2: Area must be calculated by multiplication.\nStep 3: A = 10 × 6.\nStep 4: A = 60 cm².",
          "hint": "Check whether the learner added the dimensions.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "geometry",
          "topic": "Area of a Rectangle",
