          "why": "When the area and base are known, divide the area by the base to find the perpendicular height.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A = b × h.\nStep 2: 72 = 9 × h.\nStep 3: h = 72 ÷ 9.\nStep 4: h = 8 m.",
          "hint": "Start with 72 = 9 × h.",
