          "why": "No more than means less than or equal to.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Total material used is x + y.\nStep 2: The available amount is 120 kg.\nStep 3: The amount used cannot exceed 120 kg.\nStep 4: Therefore x + y ≤ 120.",
          "hint": "No more than means the same idea as at most.",
