          "why": "The symbol ≤ allows the value to equal 10.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Substitute x = 10.\nStep 2: We get 10 ≤ 10.\nStep 3: Equality is allowed by ≤.\nStep 4: Therefore x = 10 satisfies the inequality.",
          "hint": "Remember that ≤ includes equality.",
