          "why": "The feasible region is the common solution to all constraints.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A feasible point is an allowed choice.\nStep 2: Every restriction must be satisfied.\nStep 3: Therefore every point in the feasible region satisfies every constraint.",
          "hint": "Think about the definition of feasible.",
          "subject": "math",
