          "why": "The objective is to make profit as large as possible.",
          "sol": "Step 1: P represents profit.\nStep 2: The aim is to obtain the greatest profit.\nStep 3: Therefore P must be maximized.",
          "hint": "The greatest value is the maximum.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "linear_programming",
          "topic": "Meaning of an Objective Function",
          "conceptId": "math_linear_programming_meaning_of_an_objective_function",
