          "steps": [
            "Step 1: R represents revenue.",
            "Step 2: The aim is the highest revenue.",
            "Step 3: Therefore R should be maximized."
          ],
          "why": "The objective is to make revenue as large as possible.",
          "sol": "Step 1: R represents revenue.\nStep 2: The aim is the highest revenue.\nStep 3: Therefore R should be maximized.",
          "hint": "Highest means maximum.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "linear_programming",
          "topic": "Forming a Revenue Objective Function",
          "conceptId": "math_linear_programming_forming_a_revenue_objective_function",
          "skillId": "math_linear_programming",
