          "steps": [
            "Step 1: The problem states that the minimum cost is 2400.",
            "Step 2: Therefore the optimal value is KSh 2,400."
          ],
          "why": "The optimal value is the minimum value of the objective function.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The problem states that the minimum cost is 2400.\nStep 2: Therefore the optimal value is KSh 2,400.",
          "hint": "The optimal value is the value of the objective.",
          "subject": "math",
