          "why": "Production spending cannot exceed the available budget.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Cost of A = 100x.\nStep 2: Cost of B = 250y.\nStep 3: Total cost = 100x + 250y.\nStep 4: The budget is 5000.\nStep 5: Therefore 100x + 250y ≤ 5000.",
          "hint": "Total cost must not exceed the budget.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "linear_programming",
