          "why": "A cube has three equal dimensions, so its volume is side cubed.",
          "sol": "Step 1: V = 5 × 5 × 5.\nStep 2: 5 × 5 = 25.\nStep 3: 25 × 5 = 125.",
          "hint": "V = s³.",
