          "why": "The measurements come directly from the original investigation.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The teacher measures the learners herself.\nStep 2: The measurements are collected directly.\nStep 3: Therefore, they are primary data.",
          "hint": "The teacher is collecting the measurements directly.",
          "subject": "math",
