          "sol": "Step 1: 8 + 10 + 12 + 14 = 44.\nStep 2: There are 4 observations.\nStep 3: Mean = 44 ÷ 4.\nStep 4: Mean = 11.",
          "hint": "There are 4 values.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "statistics",
