          "why": "There are 8 observations, so the total is divided into 8 equal shares.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Total = 64.\nStep 2: Number of observations = 8.\nStep 3: Mean = 64 ÷ 8.\nStep 4: Mean = 8.",
          "hint": "Use total ÷ number of observations.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "statistics",
          "topic": "33. Why We Divide by the Number of Values",
          "conceptId": "math_statistics_33_why_we_divide_by_the_number_of_values",
