          "why": "The third value is the middle of five ordered observations.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Ordered data: 3, 5, 8, 9, 11.\nStep 2: There are 5 values.\nStep 3: The middle value is 8.\nStep 4: Median = 8.",
          "hint": "Put the values from smallest to largest.",
          "subject": "math",
