          "why": "Six has three observations below it and three above it.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Ordered data: 2, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10.\nStep 2: There are 7 values.\nStep 3: The fourth value is 6.\nStep 4: Median = 6.",
          "hint": "There are 7 observations, so look for the fourth value after ordering.",
