          "sol": "Step 1: Largest = 8.\nStep 2: Smallest = −5.\nStep 3: Range = 8 − (−5).\nStep 4: Range = 8 + 5.\nStep 5: Range = 13.",
          "hint": "The smallest value is negative.",
          "subject": "math",
