          "steps": [
            "Step 1: A = 9.",
            "Step 2: B = 14.",
            "Step 3: C = 11.",
            "Step 4: The greatest value is 14.",
            "Step 5: Therefore B has the greatest frequency."
          ],
          "why": "The tallest bar represents the greatest frequency.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A = 9.\nStep 2: B = 14.\nStep 3: C = 11.\nStep 4: The greatest value is 14.\nStep 5: Therefore B has the greatest frequency.",
          "hint": "Find the greatest bar height.",
          "subject": "math",
