          "sol": "Step 1: The die can show 1.\nStep 2: It can show 2, 3, 4, 5 or 6.\nStep 3: Therefore the outcomes are {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6}.",
          "hint": "A standard die has six numbered faces.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "probability",
          "topic": "Outcomes of an Experiment",
          "conceptId": "math_probability_outcomes_of_an_experiment",
          "skillId": "math_probability",
