          "why": "These are all the choices available in the experiment.",
          "sol": "Step 1: M is a possible result.\nStep 2: N is a possible result.\nStep 3: P is a possible result.\nStep 4: Therefore S = {M, N, P}.",
          "hint": "The selected letter can be M, N or P.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "probability",
          "topic": "Listing Outcomes of a Single Experiment",
          "conceptId": "math_probability_listing_outcomes_of_a_single_experiment",
