          "sol": "Step 1: The possible outcomes are 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6.\nStep 2: 9 is not a possible outcome.\nStep 3: Therefore there are 0 favourable outcomes.\nStep 4: P(9) = 0/6 = 0.",
          "hint": "Check whether 9 is one of the possible die outcomes.",
          "subject": "math",
