          "why": "Probability 0 represents an event that cannot occur.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A probability of 0 is the lowest possible probability.\nStep 2: An event with probability 0 cannot happen.\nStep 3: Therefore the event is impossible.",
          "hint": "Think about whether the event can happen.",
          "subject": "math",
