          "why": "Head and Tail cannot occur together in one coin toss.",
          "sol": "Step 1: One coin toss produces one result.\nStep 2: The result can be Head or Tail.\nStep 3: It cannot be Head and Tail at the same time.\nStep 4: Therefore the events are mutually exclusive.",
