          "sol": "Step 1: P(A) = 3/6 = 1/2.\nStep 2: P(B) = 2/6 = 1/3.\nStep 3: A and B are mutually exclusive.\nStep 4: Therefore P(A or B) = 1/2 + 1/3.\nStep 5: 1/2 = 3/6 and 1/3 = 2/6.\nStep 6: Therefore P(A or B) = 5/6.",
