          "sol": "Step 1: First P(R) = 3/5.\nStep 2: The ball is replaced.\nStep 3: Second P(B) = 2/5.\nStep 4: P(RB) = 3/5 × 2/5 = 6/25.",
          "hint": "Both stages have the original probabilities.",
