          "sol": "Step 1: First P(B) = 2/5.\nStep 2: The selected blue ball is replaced.\nStep 3: Second P(B) = 2/5.\nStep 4: P(BB) = 2/5 × 2/5 = 4/25.",
          "hint": "P(B) is 2/5 on both stages.",
