          "sol": "Step 1: First P(R) = 3/5.\nStep 2: After removing red, 2 red remain out of 4 balls.\nStep 3: Second P(R) = 2/4.\nStep 4: P(RR) = 3/5 × 2/4.\nStep 5: P(RR) = 6/20 = 3/10.",
          "hint": "Use 3/5 first, then 2/4.",
