          "sol": "Step 1: First P(B) = 2/5.\nStep 2: After removing blue, 1 blue remains out of 4 balls.\nStep 3: Second P(B) = 1/4.\nStep 4: P(BB) = 2/5 × 1/4.\nStep 5: P(BB) = 2/20 = 1/10.",
          "hint": "After removing the first blue, only 1 blue remains.",
