          "why": "The signs record the directions of the two components.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Horizontal movement = 5 units left, so the first component is -5.\nStep 2: Vertical movement = 2 units up, so the second component is +2.\nStep 3: Therefore the vector is (-5, 2).",
