          "why": "The second component represents vertical movement.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The bottom entry represents vertical movement.\nStep 2: The bottom entry is 8.\nStep 3: Therefore the vertical component is 8.",
          "hint": "The vertical component is the bottom entry.",
