          "why": "Left and down represent negative movement on the coordinate plane.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Left gives horizontal component -4.\nStep 2: Down gives vertical component -6.\nStep 3: Therefore the column vector is (-4, -6).",
          "hint": "Both left and down have negative signs.",
