          "why": "The coordinates of A are the components of its position vector.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A = (6, 4).\nStep 2: The x-coordinate is 6.\nStep 3: The y-coordinate is 4.\nStep 4: Therefore OA = (6, 4).",
