          "steps": [
            "Step 1: a - b = (-4, 6) - (3, 2).",
            "Step 2: Horizontal: -4 - 3 = -7.",
            "Step 3: Vertical: 6 - 2 = 4.",
            "Step 4: Therefore a - b = (-7, 4)."
          ],
          "why": "The negative horizontal component results from -4 - 3.",
          "sol": "Step 1: a - b = (-4, 6) - (3, 2).\nStep 2: Horizontal: -4 - 3 = -7.\nStep 3: Vertical: 6 - 2 = 4.\nStep 4: Therefore a - b = (-7, 4).",
          "hint": "Subtract the components of b from the corresponding components of a.",
