          "why": "Scalar multiplication applies to every component.",
          "sol": "Step 1: 4c = (4 × 6, 4 × -5).\nStep 2: 4 × 6 = 24.\nStep 3: 4 × -5 = -20.\nStep 4: Therefore 4c = (24, -20).",
          "hint": "Multiply 6 and -5 by 4.",
